---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Awesome AECO"
  description="Privacy policy for Awesome AECO website, catalog.json endpoint, and the awesome-aeco-mcp server."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>
        Last updated: November 26, 2026. Applies to <code>awesome-aeco.org</code>,
        <code>catalog.json</code>, and the hosted <code>awesome-aeco-mcp</code> server at
        <code>https://mcp.awesome-aeco.org/mcp</code>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 780px;">
      <article class="card" style="margin-block-end: 1.5rem;">
        <h2>1. No Accounts, No Tracking, No Personal Data Storage</h2>
        <p>
          Awesome AECO and <code>awesome-aeco-mcp</code> are public, read-only open-source resources.
          We do not require user accounts, authentication, cookies, or analytics trackers, and we do
          not store personal data, prompts, or query histories on any database.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card" style="margin-block-end: 1.5rem;">
        <h2>2. How MCP Requests Are Processed</h2>
        <p>
          The hosted MCP server at <code>https://mcp.awesome-aeco.org/mcp</code> runs as a stateless
          Cloudflare Worker. Incoming tool calls (<code>search_tools</code>, <code>get_tool</code>,
          <code>list_categories</code>, <code>list_tags</code>, <code>get_movers</code>,
          <code>check_before_building</code>, and <code>draft_submission</code>) are
          evaluated in memory against the public <code>catalog.json</code> dataset and returned
          directly to your AI client. No request payloads are persisted to third-party services.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card" style="margin-block-end: 1.5rem;">
        <h2>3. Infrastructure Logs</h2>
        <p>
          Our static site is hosted on GitHub Pages and the remote MCP endpoint is hosted on
          Cloudflare Workers. Both infrastructure providers may process standard transient network
          metadata (such as IP address, HTTP status codes, and latency metrics) for security,
          DDoS protection, and operational observability under their respective privacy policies.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>4. Contact &amp; Support</h2>
        <p>
          Questions or privacy requests can be opened via
          <a href="https://github.com/awesome-aeco/awesome-aeco-mcp/issues" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            GitHub Issues
          </a>
          or by contacting the maintainer listed on
          <a href="https://github.com/awesome-aeco/Awesome-AECO" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            github.com/awesome-aeco/Awesome-AECO
          </a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
